Output examples/recordings/full_stack_distributed_demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20

Type "# Aetheris-MemOS: Full-Stack Distributed Memory Demo"
